{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0031","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"choose_median_with_outlier","difficultyScore":2.0,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"choose_median_with_outlier","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Masa menyiapkan tugas bagi lima percubaan ialah 12, 13, 12, 14 dan 39 minit. Jika mahu satu nilai yang kurang dipengaruhi bacaan luar biasa 39, ukuran manakah paling sesuai?","options":["Min, 18 minit","Maksimum, 39 minit","Median, 13 minit","Julat, 27 minit"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Susun data: 12,12,13,14,39; nilai tengah ialah 13.","Median kurang dipengaruhi nilai luar biasa berbanding min."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0031-choose_median_with_outlier","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0032","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"compare_defect_rate_not_count","difficultyScore":2.3,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"compare_defect_rate_not_count","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Barisan A menghasilkan 200 unit dengan 8 rosak. Barisan B menghasilkan 100 unit dengan 6 rosak. Jika mahu menentukan barisan yang lebih bermasalah secara adil, apakah kesimpulan terbaik?","options":["Barisan A, kerana 8 lebih besar daripada 6","Kedua-duanya 4%","Tidak boleh dibandingkan","Barisan B, kerana kadar rosaknya 6%"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["A: 8/200=4%.","B: 6/100=6%, jadi B mempunyai kadar kerosakan lebih tinggi."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0032-compare_defect_rate_not_count","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0033","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"trend_from_four_periods","difficultyScore":2.5,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"trend_from_four_periods","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Penggunaan elektrik mingguan ialah 120, 118, 121 dan 160 kWh. Mesin baharu mula digunakan pada minggu keempat. Apakah langkah analisis seterusnya paling berguna?","options":["Banding penggunaan mesin baharu dengan kenaikan 39–42 kWh pada minggu keempat","Anggap semua minggu sama","Buang minggu keempat tanpa semakan","Gunakan hanya minggu pertama sebagai kesimpulan"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Tiga minggu awal hampir stabil sekitar 118–121 kWh.","Kenaikan besar berlaku serentak dengan mesin baharu, jadi penggunaan mesin itu wajar disemak sebagai kemungkinan penyumbang."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0033-trend_from_four_periods","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0034","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"sample_repeated_measure_average_after_verification","difficultyScore":1.8,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"sample_repeated_measure_average_after_verification","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Tiga bacaan panjang yang telah disahkan sah ialah 10.2 cm, 10.4 cm dan 10.3 cm. Nilai wakil yang paling sesuai ialah?","options":["10.2 cm","10.3 cm","10.4 cm","30.9 cm"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Semua bacaan hampir dan telah disahkan sah.","Purata=(10.2+10.4+10.3)/3=10.3 cm."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0034-sample_repeated_measure_average_after_verification","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0035","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"percentage_change_for_fair_comparison","difficultyScore":2.4,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"percentage_change_for_fair_comparison","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Cawangan P meningkat jualan daripada 100 kepada 120 unit. Cawangan Q meningkat daripada 40 kepada 52 unit. Cawangan mana menunjukkan peningkatan peratus lebih besar?","options":["Cawangan P, 20%","Kedua-duanya 20%","Cawangan Q, 30%","Cawangan P, 30%"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["P meningkat 20 daripada 100 =20%.","Q meningkat 12 daripada 40 =30%, jadi Q lebih besar."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0035-percentage_change_for_fair_comparison","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0036","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"equal_pack_distribution_with_remainder","difficultyScore":1.8,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"equal_pack_distribution_with_remainder","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Sebanyak 53 kit hendak dibahagi sama rata kepada 6 kumpulan. Setiap kumpulan perlu menerima bilangan sama dan baki disimpan. Berapa kit setiap kumpulan dan berapa baki?","options":["9 setiap kumpulan, baki 1","8 setiap kumpulan, baki 3","7 setiap kumpulan, baki 11","8 setiap kumpulan, baki 5"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["53÷6 =8 dengan baki 5.","6×8=48 dan 53−48=5."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0036-equal_pack_distribution_with_remainder","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0037","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"proportional_budget_two_departments","difficultyScore":1.9,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"proportional_budget_two_departments","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Bajet RM600 dibahagi antara Unit A dan B mengikut nisbah 2:3. Berapa peruntukan Unit B?","options":["RM360","RM240","RM300","RM400"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah bahagian=2+3=5.","Unit B menerima 3/5×RM600=RM360."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0037-proportional_budget_two_departments","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0038","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"minimum_stock_after_equal_issue","difficultyScore":1.6,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"minimum_stock_after_equal_issue","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Stor mempunyai 96 sarung tangan. Empat pasukan masing-masing diberi 18 pasang. Berapa stok tinggal?","options":["18 pasang","24 pasang","28 pasang","32 pasang"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah diberi=4×18=72.","Baki=96−72=24."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0038-minimum_stock_after_equal_issue","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0039","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"allocate_limited_devices_by_shift","difficultyScore":2.0,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"allocate_limited_devices_by_shift","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Terdapat 10 tablet. Sesi pagi memerlukan 6 tablet dan sesi petang 7 tablet, tetapi kedua-dua sesi tidak bertindih. Adakah 10 tablet mencukupi tanpa membeli tambahan?","options":["Tidak, perlu 13 tablet serentak","Tidak, kurang 3 tablet","Ya, kerana tablet boleh digunakan semula pada sesi petang","Ya, tetapi hanya jika 3 tablet rosak"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Keperluan tidak berlaku serentak.","Maksimum pada satu masa ialah 7 tablet, jadi 10 mencukupi dan boleh digunakan semula."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0039-allocate_limited_devices_by_shift","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0040","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"fair_rotation_when_resource_short","difficultyScore":1.7,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"fair_rotation_when_resource_short","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Empat kumpulan memerlukan satu alat yang sama selama 15 minit setiap satu. Hanya satu alat tersedia dan masa keseluruhan 60 minit. Kaedah manakah memastikan semua kumpulan mendapat masa sama tanpa bertindih?","options":["Dua kumpulan 30 minit, dua kumpulan tiada slot","Semua guna serentak","Satu kumpulan guna 60 minit","Empat slot berturut-turut 15 minit"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["4×15=60 minit tepat sama dengan masa tersedia.","Membuat empat slot berasingan memberi setiap kumpulan masa sama dan elak pertindihan."],"patternSignature":"ps-b001-0040-fair_rotation_when_resource_short","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
